# Front-of-house product facts

After changing Mālo amounts, exclusive price, booster tiers, Aura math, operator PIN, Connect identity, payout queue copy, demo RLS, athlete sports, class years, the team catalog, Highlight / Highlights ⚡ / profile-tab labels, Vault lock / Open Vault copy, or admin platform cuts:

1. Run `pnpm docs:sync` in the same turn (`docs:check` also requires every `schema.sql` table/RPC to appear in `docs/SCHEMA.md`).
2. Never hand-edit inside `<!-- product-facts:start -->` … `<!-- product-facts:end -->`.
3. Do not invent legal conclusions. `LEGAL_BRIEFING.md` analysis outside the markers stays human-written.
4. If those prices or caveats changed, update the investor canvas when it is available.
